#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0016 expect=skipped domain=LB
#note "dataset LB without the LBDRVFL column (STRESC present and empty on the row - would otherwise be a candidate). Requirements.Variables.All [--DRVFL] gates -> auditable skip. FAMILY-CONSISTENCY pin: the FDA twin has NO such All entry and executes silently on the same data (the SD0053-batch asymmetry shape); PMDA's auditable-skip side is the one pinned here."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset LB class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col LBSEQ    type=Num
col LBTESTCD type=Char
col LBSTRESC type=Char
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | GLUC |
